Package: memveil
Version: @UPSTREAM@-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Maintainer: Denis Mingulov <denis@mingulov.com>
Description: swiotlb bounce-attempt capture and offline replay on x86-64 Linux
 Record swiotlb bounce activity, mapping lifetimes, and executed
 copies into a self-describing capture directory, then replay it
 offline as text, JSON, or Markdown. Counts are try-counts with
 requested bytes; actual copies come from the copy channel.
 .
 Third-party binary package: built outside the archive from the
 MemVeil sources with the pinned Rust toolchain. Installed
 runs need no flags or environment: profiles resolve from
 the installed share dir and qualify receipts land under
 /var/lib/memveil/receipts.
X-Memveil-Revision: @REVISION@
X-Memveil-Cargo-Lock: @CARGO_LOCK@
X-Memveil-Build-Tools: @BUILD_TOOLS@
